  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.19",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.19\n\nReleased on 2026-11-06.\n\nA render now matches preview when a `set` interrupts a running tween, so it no longer comes out blank. `cloud render` also keeps going when a project uses a font with no file on this computer. It falls back to the next font in the stack, as a local render does, and names the missing font.\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **CLI:** A font missing from this computer no longer stops a cloud render, and is named ([b56e2c036](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/b56e2c03669cc0515209b0f886594b36867eab02), [#7287](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7287)).\n- **Core:** A render lands where preview does when a set interrupts a tween ([6abc62a17](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/6abc62a1796f7ebafd001dd13869a049f1f87dc5), [#7283](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7283)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.18...v0.9.19\n"
